ASoC: q6apm: coordinate the reference paired PA start from PCM trigger

PREPARE already runs the muted DSP graph. START only proves the mute epoch and coordinates both PAs plus protection clocks.
Do not send a second DSP START and keep every muted/audit fixture on its existing path.
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-dai.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-dai.c
@@ -418,6 +418,9 @@
